# Bench run artifacts
#
# Output of a bench run, regenerable by re-running the specification. None of it
# is source. ble_commands.md in particular is a generated results table headed
# "Result: PASS" - committed, it would be indistinguishable from bench evidence,
# which is what TB-DEV-001 and TB-SUP9-001 section 8 exist to prevent.
#
# *.log covers ble_session.log and sensor_rtt.log by pattern, and the logs any
# other specification writes. No .log file is tracked in this repository.
#
# The markdown and JSON rules are anchored to the repository root on purpose.
# specs/sensor_commands.md is tracked source, not a report, and the firmware
# manifests under benches/simulated/ are tracked fixtures.
*.log
/ble_commands.md
/report.md
/benchtools_result*.json
/bench_*.json
results/
